### GET /members — default page (50 items)
GET {{host}}/members
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### GET /members — 2 items
GET {{host}}/members?per_page=2
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### GET /members — page 2
GET {{host}}/members?page=2
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### GET /members — per_page above the cap (expect at most 100)
GET {{host}}/members?per_page=101
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### GET /members — search by name
GET {{host}}/members?search=lee
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### GET /members — search spanning the space
GET {{host}}/members?search=na%20Ha
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### GET /members — literal underscore
GET {{host}}/members?search=_
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### GET /members — literal percent (expect [])
GET {{host}}/members?search=%25
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### GET /members — invalid page (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/members?page=0
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### GET /members — invalid per_page (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/members?per_page=abc
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### GET /members — no API key (expect 401)
GET {{host}}/members
